# M4. Any handle press stops motion: Talk during an offered move, then Confirm during a terminal move. The
# press that stops is the motion's, so Talk doesn't start a recording.
expect motion mode ready
key torque-on-left
wait 2100
key c
expect motion torque left on
key offer-ready-left
wait 2100
key c
expect motion command arm.go_to_pose started offer
wait 200
key t
expect motion command arm.go_to_pose stopped offer
expect motion stop handle_press
absent 500 talk recording
# On the servos: held within 5° of where it is, and no goal written after the stop's hold.
wait 200
key inspect-hold-left
expect sim left follower hold ok
absent 1000 sim goal-write left follower
# The hold read the arm first: each goal is where the arm was at the stop, within 0.5°.
key inspect-hold-tight-left
expect sim left follower hold tight ok
# A move from the terminal, stopped by a Confirm press.
key pose-handover-left
expect motion target arm.go_to_pose operator_cli
wait 2100
key c
expect motion command arm.go_to_pose started operator_cli
wait 200
key c
expect motion command arm.go_to_pose stopped operator_cli
expect motion stop handle_press
wait 200
key inspect-hold-left
expect sim left follower hold ok
absent 1000 sim goal-write left follower
# The hold read the arm first: each goal is where the arm was at the stop, within 0.5°.
key inspect-hold-tight-left
expect sim left follower hold tight ok
key q
